{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FOX XII</strong> is a <strong> hybrid shooter</strong> that blends intense combat, dungeon crawling, and deep rogue-lite progression. Battle through procedurally generated dungeons, uncover powerful loot, and evolve your build with every run in this action-packed ARPG experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes the first chapter and first few dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892460/extras/8518fa2719ce8276c3c3ddddad4a1160.avif?t=1753772731\" /></div>You play as a spec-ops soldier trapped in an unfamiliar and supernatural environment where every corridor hides enemies, secrets, loot, and gear. Swap freely between top-down tactical gunfights and over-the-shoulder third-person precision as you adapt to shifting threats and unique room layouts. Death is not the end. Each run builds your permanent skills, unlocking new abilities, weapons, and combat styles.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892460?t=1753772731","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892460/d1c4d81c591a394c1ae75f8aeb0e037353712b18/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753772731","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892460/f88d213e8c66611d30a9d1e72f40ce6be51154a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753772731","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892460/f88d213e8c66611d30a9d1e72f40ce6be51154a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753772731","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descrip